OL,3,GNEWSA'Extreme heat' has caused 200
OL,4,Acancelled surgeries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 200 elective procedures have been
OL,7,Fcancelled in Jersey over the summer
OL,8,Fmonths due to the failure of chiller
OL,9,Funits in operating theatres, hospital
OL,10,Fbosses have said.
OL,12,FThe scale of cancellations at Jersey
OL,13,FHospital has been confirmed in a report
OL,14,Fto August's meeting of the island's
OL,15,Fhealthcare oversight board.
OL,17,FManaging director Andy Weir said
OL,18,Fefforts had been made to "minimise and
OL,19,Fmanage the disruption", but
OL,20,Facknowledged staff had been working in
OL,21,F"far from ideal circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
